{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xGvpIk9r7i1793053655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價個別發展。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合143.09元，比本港收市高0.89元。工商銀行7.42元，低2仙。建設銀行9.92元，與本港收市持平。友邦保險71.58元，高0.73元。港交所372.05元，低0.35元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股385.54元，低0.86元。阿里巴巴98.3元，高0.35元。理想汽車44.52元，高6仙。金沙中國10.99元，高1仙。長和64.79元，低0.56元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.684183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:58:18.630145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T22:58:15.207518+00:00","content_hash":"d622d84bda138b1587424416cfff6d83c2c8816b787fbc9099f82bb664d26ca8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.684183+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}